sentences.text:
In the event of arrest of the applicant, she shall be released on interim anticipatory bail on her furnishing a personal bond of Rs.50,000/- with two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions:-
(i) The applicant shall make herself available before the court concerned on the date fixed in the matter;
(ii) The applicant shall not directly or indirectly, make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him /
her from disclosing such facts to the Court or to any police officer;

